WEBVTT

00:07:59.225 --> 00:08:01.810
for the bus card
that I gave him in exchange

00:08:01.852 --> 00:08:04.021
for the interview that took place,

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:05.940
and for being there for him.

00:08:07.149 --> 00:08:08.609
For being there.

00:08:09.735 --> 00:08:10.861
What did I do?

00:08:12.738 --> 00:08:15.366
Jimmy's life moved
from one rejection to another.

00:08:17.034 --> 00:08:19.411
The prison refused him psychiatric care.

00:08:19.995 --> 00:08:23.415
The social service agency
shuttered its doors.

00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:27.086
Without me, he wouldn't have made it
to his appointment.

00:08:27.127 --> 00:08:28.963
And with me, it just didn't matter,

00:08:28.963 --> 00:08:31.340
he was turned away anyway.